  "name": "Order Form",
  "description": "Take product orders online: items and quantities, size or variant, delivery or pickup, address, date and order notes.",
  "category": "Marketing & Sales",
  "seoTitle": "Free Order Form Template for Small Businesses",
  "seoDescription": "Order form template that collects customer details, products, quantities, sizes, delivery or pickup, address, preferred date and notes. Take orders by link.",
